# c4a0150d911747f9850844fb561daa56
#: ../installation/update.rst:5 d3ad0ff8e45e4fbc84844f094894735c
msgid "Updating"
msgstr ""

# 85c8c8a096ee48a2bf0c808fa88789f9
#: ../installation/update.rst:7 194670cf293944269e63ea40a41f14ac
msgid "If you are using an old Galette release, it's time to update."
msgstr ""

# 8f2753c896f64b7bb6c50fdc0cfbd460
#: ../installation/update.rst:11 a2418817edde4673b3352c9f0a7ca543
msgid ""
"An update is often not something lite, your data may be modified. So, please "
"make sure you made **a backup of your current database**, or you may lost "
"all or a part of your data."
msgstr ""

# 0ce3fcfa5743401f903cb46007cc96d3
#: ../installation/update.rst:13 e7f77ecda425486ca1513565bbb8806b
msgid ""
"A backup of all Galette files is also recommended it would be helpful if you "
"find a bug that prevent you to migrate and have to restore an old version;"
msgstr ""

# b770437d655d45a5873376dab5ea469a
#: ../installation/update.rst:17 26707a986f754172a9e080a18754d2aa
msgid ""
"Migrating a pre 0.7 release is theoretically supported, but this is not "
"tested (those releases are more than 10 years old!), and it is possible your "
"attempt fail."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:19 f587df8ae36140bcb164db17f65506ff
msgid ""
"Nothing is really made to make such a time travel ;) If this is your case, "
"you should first `migrate to Galette 0.7.8 <https://galette.eu/download/"
"archives/galette-0.7.8.tar.bz2>`_; and do another migration to the latest "
"version."
msgstr ""

# ddeccd27b1d24d1fa7bc1e6121cd20f1
#: ../installation/update.rst:22 521d8c63aa354b6c85d8ceb3149c4b4c
msgid "Updating files"
msgstr ""

# b2893b3c6eaa42f5851407515c09fa7b
#: ../installation/update.rst:24 a4198db9ee3f476a9ad2250687457cd1
msgid ""
"First, logout from your instance, and make sure to use a maintenance mode to "
"prevent other users to reach the instance."
msgstr ""

# aceb420907fd4016ab8456495e0057dd
#: ../installation/update.rst:26 5044c69a8bdb42c4bcc37f989cdd7b61
msgid ""
"Then, download latest Galette version and replace the files. For more "
"information on files installation, refer to the :ref:`prepare installation "
"<preparation>` section."
msgstr ""

# ce34ab9888eb41309710dc28ae856a61
#: ../installation/update.rst:28 446524608c2946e5ac6ef038773be679
msgid ""
"Some directories keep data and/or configurations and should be copied back "
"to the new instance:"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:30 fca17f8bddf045df85da044b5db0b9c7
msgid ""
"``config/config.inc.php``. If the file is present, the update reads "
"everything from it - database password included - and never asks you for a "
"credential again. If it is missing, Galette cannot know it is an update: it "
"would offer a brand new installation instead,"
msgstr ""

# 59761ec82cf74838a2db9a5cc53387dd
#: ../installation/update.rst:31 c53e78889f964675b4b66571b543e2de
msgid "``data/photos`` your members photos and logos,"
msgstr ""

# 0ca3359130544cfcacb40341ff080017
#: ../installation/update.rst:32 01c9f6e5bd6341a8b835192f82a6b48c
msgid "``data/exports`` contains CSv exports,"
msgstr ""

# 97ca05c6a7a245f391d2ed8fdad9594b
#: ../installation/update.rst:33 27d134a7e6f04b8abc724d017a82ea78
msgid "``data/files`` contains files from dynamic fields of type file,"
msgstr ""

# 17dae2c5a3f743629de6c20ace036605
#: ../installation/update.rst:34 aedcb0c8296f4c0cb22e418dc7b4b305
msgid "``data/attachments`` contains mailing attached documents."
msgstr ""

# e80f2ec427564a80aad7a5fad00df093
#: ../installation/update.rst:35 24d9d389505e4ef5b12f375b3c23f75b
msgid ""
"``plugins`` your current plugins. It is a good idea to check if new plugins "
"versions are available ;)"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:37 a9c2ee3e4e1b4dd3bc2463eca614ed71
msgid ""
"Once files are updated, go to your Galette instance. It will ask you if "
"needed to proceed to the update of your database."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:39 52dc97aec3e946efaeb3b36d6061cd09
msgid ""
"If so, :ref:`enable the installer <enableinstaller>` by creating the ``data/"
"ENABLE_INSTALL`` file, then visit the install URL ``/installer.php`` (ex: "
"https://your.domain.name/installer.php). Galette sees your configuration "
"file and runs an update, you have nothing to choose."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:41 1b03bc57003a440b8a6dd0b5b7be9b95
msgid "If it asks you nothing you're just done already ;)"
msgstr ""

# 4b6889058e484a889fe18f9a3afa4a78
#: ../installation/update.rst:45 efe173f7aea94d6b820e1d3349e4ea5f
msgid "Updating database"
msgstr ""

# 621d9cdcb39d49a99b7e21bb86741bba
#: ../installation/update.rst:49 b2f68d2f4ee34b4ea7f33158838696ea
msgid ""
"Installing a new Galette release does not strictly means a database update "
"will be required! Sometimes, only updating the files will be enough; even "
"for a major release."
msgstr ""

# 37b53ace7af742b3986e4f751629065d
#: ../installation/update.rst:51 4b3be04ab2854cf78a7f7311190d9583
msgid ""
"Galette will tell you if an update is needed, no need to \"force\" an update."
msgstr ""

# 8900502e7ad444ccb72966ba1fdb29a1
#: ../installation/update.rst:53 1883aae4fbcc472799f283f7456f4f69
msgid ""
"Update process is very similar to :doc:`Galette installation process "
"<galette>`, with some steps that change. All is mostly transparent, "
"information are provided on each step."
msgstr ""

# e946375277c34dbfa2f2bb7f268a7351
#: ../installation/update.rst:56 4e4d3e870fde44b8a57d0bbba5fd159e
msgid "Database information"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:60 9a6e1145d1e54036a166a1fb4d9373c3
msgid ""
"Database information are not asked anymore, and neither is the installation "
"type."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:62 fc6dd895b9244ed4aac6f12ac0187445
msgid ""
"The update reads the database type, host, port, name, user, password and "
"table prefix from your configuration file, and goes straight to the access "
"and permissions check. The form only comes back if that file cannot be read "
"or is incomplete - fill it in with the very same information as before, the "
"table prefix included."
msgstr ""

# be706b5e535a48ea88ebb5ce1915865c
#: ../installation/update.rst:65 d26df1746e3245af8c93d132e46585e8
msgid "Previous version selection"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:69 7a8229ac502e4de48ff76c9034355d9d
msgid "When the version can be read from the database, this step is skipped."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:71 0b37891b0dab42f48fe3448624a98852
msgid ""
"Galette reads the version its database holds and updates from there. The "
"step below is only displayed when that reading is not conclusive - which is "
"the case for a pre 0.7 database, since the table holding the version did not "
"exist yet. Select the version you are coming from, the one Galette guessed "
"is displayed as bold text:"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:77 c3deb332b9cb4cd0b6f6bcb2e9736cad
msgid ""
"The step is also displayed when your database is already up to date, so you "
"get a chance to stop before running the scripts again:"
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:83 35944a775ff74bc2b7a58b61dc99edce
msgid "Once update scripts have run, a summary will be displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../installation/update.rst:87 57d66713277d49f3bd31cdb0792d679a
msgid ""
"The ``data/ENABLE_INSTALL`` file is removed once the update has completed."
msgstr ""
